{
  "format": "roy.channelPreset",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Crystal Hard Vocal - clear, light tune",
  "created": "2026-09-29T00:00:00Z",
  "app": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Very produced but CLEAR voice: light natural autotune (35 ms, 60 %), clean low end, lots of presence and air, heavy but clean compression, subtle warmth, strong de-esser, doubler width, 1/4 delay, bright plate-like reverb, limiter at -1 dB. No distortion. CLEAR-VOICE version: words stay understandable (presence up, mud out, effects kept behind the voice).",
